          <h3>Is it legal to touch petroglyphs?</h3>
          <p>No. Federal law prohibits touching, defacing, or removing petroglyphs and archaeological artifacts. Oils from skin contact accelerate deterioration. Photograph from a respectful distance and never touch the rock surface.</p>
        </div>
